::Q006::[markdown]ἠθέληκα:{
	~%-100%make#Incorrect. **ποιέω** is Principal Part 1 of **ποιέω** “make” (Chapter 9).
	~%100%to be willing#Correct: **ἠθέληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
