	~%-100%die#Incorrect. **τελευτάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τελευτάω** “die” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%(middle) obey#Incorrect. **πείθω** is Principal Part 1 of **πείθω** “(middle) obey” (Chapter 5).
